Fix sm75 compatibility by falling back to native ops

Some fused CUDA kernels used by sgl_kernel can fail on pre-Ampere GPUs
with errors such as "no kernel image is available for execution on the
device".

Add a capability guard for CUDA devices with compute capability < 8.0
and fall back to the existing PyTorch-native implementations for:
- SiluAndMul
- GeluAndMul
- RMSNorm
- GemmaRMSNorm

This keeps the optimized fused path on Ampere and newer GPUs while
restoring correctness and startup stability on sm75 devices.
